2Ch 20:1 , Jehoshaphat, invaded by Moab, proclaims a fast;
2Ch 20:5 , His prayer;
2Ch 20:14 , The prophecy of Jahaziel;
2Ch 20:20 , Jehoshaphat exhorts the people, and sets singers to praise the Lord;
2Ch 20:22 , The great overthrow of his enemies;
2Ch 20:26 , The people, having blessed God at Berachah, return in triumph;
2Ch 20:31 , Jehoshaphat's reign;
2Ch 20:35 , His convoy of ships, according to the prophecy of Eliezer, unhappily perish.
